./pkg/windows/README.md:1:This directory contains a Windows manifest for various Windows-specific
./pkg/windows/README.md:2:settings.
./pkg/windows/README.md:3:
./pkg/windows/README.md:4:The main thing we enable here is [`longPathAware`], which permits paths of the
./pkg/windows/README.md:5:form `C:\` to be longer than 260 characters.
./pkg/windows/README.md:6:
./pkg/windows/README.md:7:The approach taken here was modeled off of a [similar change for `rustc`][rustc pr].
./pkg/windows/README.md:8:In particular, this manifest gets linked into the final binary. Those linker
./pkg/windows/README.md:9:arguments are applied in `build.rs`.
./pkg/windows/README.md:10:
./pkg/windows/README.md:11:This currently only applies to MSVC builds. If there's an easy way to make this
./pkg/windows/README.md:12:apply to GNU builds as well, then patches are welcome.
./pkg/windows/README.md:13:
./pkg/windows/README.md:14:[`longPathAware`]: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/sbscs/application-manifests#longpathaware
./pkg/windows/README.md:15:[rustc pr]: https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/pull/96737
