./CHANGELOG.md:1:TBD
./CHANGELOG.md:2:===
./CHANGELOG.md:3:Unreleased changes. Release notes have not yet been written.
./CHANGELOG.md:4:
./CHANGELOG.md:5:
./CHANGELOG.md:6:15.2.0 (2026-07-15)
./CHANGELOG.md:7:===================
./CHANGELOG.md:8:This release fixes a number of bugs related to gitignore matching as well as
./CHANGELOG.md:9:some performance improvements in directory tree traversal.
./CHANGELOG.md:10:
./CHANGELOG.md:11:Platform support:
./CHANGELOG.md:12:
./CHANGELOG.md:13:* `aarch64-unknown-linux-musl` is now included in the release binaries for
./CHANGELOG.md:14:  ripgrep.
./CHANGELOG.md:15:
./CHANGELOG.md:16:Performance improvements:
./CHANGELOG.md:17:
./CHANGELOG.md:18:* [PERF #3293](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/3293):
./CHANGELOG.md:19:  Improves directory traversal time on very large corpora.
./CHANGELOG.md:20:
./CHANGELOG.md:21:Feature enhancements:
./CHANGELOG.md:22:
./CHANGELOG.md:23:* [FEATURE #3275](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/3275):
./CHANGELOG.md:24:  ripgrep now respects `GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL` and `GIT_CONFIG_SYSTEM`.
./CHANGELOG.md:25:
./CHANGELOG.md:26:Bug fixes:
./CHANGELOG.md:27:
./CHANGELOG.md:28:* [BUG #3212](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/3212):
./CHANGELOG.md:29:  Don't check for the existence of `.jj` when `--no-ignore` is used.
./CHANGELOG.md:30:* [BUG #3320](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/3419),
./CHANGELOG.md:31:  [BUG #3376](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/3376),
./CHANGELOG.md:32:  [BUG #3419](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/3419):
./CHANGELOG.md:33:  Fix gitignore matching bug when searching across multiple directories.
./CHANGELOG.md:34:
./CHANGELOG.md:35:
./CHANGELOG.md:36:15.1.0 (2025-10-22)
./CHANGELOG.md:37:===================
./CHANGELOG.md:38:This is a small release that fixes a bug with how ripgrep handles line
./CHANGELOG.md:39:buffering. This might manifest as ripgrep printing output later than you
./CHANGELOG.md:40:expect or not working correctly with `tail -f` (even if you're using the
./CHANGELOG.md:41:`--line-buffered` flag).
./CHANGELOG.md:42:
./CHANGELOG.md:43:Bug fixes:
./CHANGELOG.md:44:
./CHANGELOG.md:45:* [BUG #3194](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/3194):
./CHANGELOG.md:46:  Fix a regression with `--line-buffered` introduced in ripgrep 15.0.0.
./CHANGELOG.md:47:
./CHANGELOG.md:48:Feature enhancements:
./CHANGELOG.md:49:
./CHANGELOG.md:50:* [FEATURE #3192](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/3192):
./CHANGELOG.md:51:  Add hyperlink alias for Cursor.
./CHANGELOG.md:52:
./CHANGELOG.md:53:
./CHANGELOG.md:54:15.0.0 (2025-10-15)
./CHANGELOG.md:55:===================
./CHANGELOG.md:56:ripgrep 15 is a new major version release of ripgrep that mostly has bug fixes,
./CHANGELOG.md:57:some minor performance improvements and minor new features. Here are some
./CHANGELOG.md:58:highlights:
./CHANGELOG.md:59:
./CHANGELOG.md:60:* Several bugs around gitignore matching have been fixed. This includes
./CHANGELOG.md:61:  a commonly reported bug related to applying gitignore rules from parent
./CHANGELOG.md:62:  directories.
./CHANGELOG.md:63:* A memory usage regression when handling very large gitignore files has been
./CHANGELOG.md:64:  fixed.
./CHANGELOG.md:65:* `rg -vf file`, where `file` is empty, now matches everything.
./CHANGELOG.md:66:* The `-r/--replace` flag now works with `--json`.
./CHANGELOG.md:67:* A subset of Jujutsu (`jj`) repositories are now treated as if they were git
./CHANGELOG.md:68:  repositories. That is, ripgrep will respect `jj`'s gitignores.
./CHANGELOG.md:69:* Globs can now use nested curly braces.
./CHANGELOG.md:70:
./CHANGELOG.md:71:Platform support:
./CHANGELOG.md:72:
./CHANGELOG.md:73:* `aarch64` for Windows now has release artifacts.
./CHANGELOG.md:74:* `powerpc64` no longer has release artifacts generated for it. The CI
./CHANGELOG.md:75:  release workflow stopped working, and I didn't deem it worth my time to
./CHANGELOG.md:76:  debug it. If someone wants this and can test it, I'd be happy to add it
./CHANGELOG.md:77:  back.
./CHANGELOG.md:78:* ripgrep binaries are now compiled with full LTO enabled. You may notice
./CHANGELOG.md:79:  small performance improvements from this and a modest decrease in binary
./CHANGELOG.md:80:  size.
./CHANGELOG.md:81:
./CHANGELOG.md:82:Performance improvements:
./CHANGELOG.md:83:
./CHANGELOG.md:84:* [PERF #2111](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2111):
./CHANGELOG.md:85:  Don't resolve helper binaries on Windows when `-z/--search-zip` isn't used.
./CHANGELOG.md:86:* [PERF #2865](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/2865):
./CHANGELOG.md:87:  Avoid using path canonicalization on Windows when emitting hyperlinks.
./CHANGELOG.md:88:
./CHANGELOG.md:89:Bug fixes:
./CHANGELOG.md:90:
./CHANGELOG.md:91:* [BUG #829](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/829),
./CHANGELOG.md:92:  [BUG #2731](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2731),
./CHANGELOG.md:93:  [BUG #2747](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2747),
./CHANGELOG.md:94:  [BUG #2770](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2770),
./CHANGELOG.md:95:  [BUG #2778](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2778),
./CHANGELOG.md:96:  [BUG #2836](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2836),
./CHANGELOG.md:97:  [BUG #2933](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/2933),
./CHANGELOG.md:98:  [BUG #3067](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/3067):
./CHANGELOG.md:99:  Fix bug related to gitignores from parent directories.
./CHANGELOG.md:100:* [BUG #1332](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/1332),
./CHANGELOG.md:101:  [BUG #3001](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/3001):
./CHANGELOG.md:102:  Make `rg -vf file` where `file` is empty match everything.
./CHANGELOG.md:103:* [BUG #2177](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2177):
./CHANGELOG.md:104:  Ignore a UTF-8 BOM marker at the start of `.gitignore` (and similar files).
./CHANGELOG.md:105:* [BUG #2750](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2750):
./CHANGELOG.md:106:  Fix memory usage regression for some truly large gitignore files.
./CHANGELOG.md:107:* [BUG #2944](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/2944):
./CHANGELOG.md:108:  Fix a bug where the "bytes searched" in `--stats` output could be incorrect.
./CHANGELOG.md:109:* [BUG #2990](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2990):
./CHANGELOG.md:110:  Fix a bug where ripgrep would mishandle globs that ended with a `.`.
