./CHANGELOG.md:548:===================
./CHANGELOG.md:549:ripgrep 12.1.0 is a small minor version release that mostly includes bug fixes
./CHANGELOG.md:550:and documentation improvements. This release also contains some important
./CHANGELOG.md:551:notices for downstream packagers.
